<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84545" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαπλόος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλαπλᾰσι-πλοῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆ</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>manifold, many times as long,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος διπλοῦς καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					75b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνομα πολλαπλοῦν</span>
			<i>multi-compound,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπλοῦν,
				διπλοῦν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1457a35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἡ ἐνέργεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Comm. Math.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνὴρ διπλοῦς, π.,</span> i.e.
				<i>not simple and straightforward,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				397e
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
